## Recommended Next Session

When picking this back up, the suggested order is:

1. **Merge PRs** after code review feedback is addressed:
   - Backend: [footballBackEnd#2](https://github.com/rdhPersonal/footballBackEnd/pull/2) — testing, data scripts, Node 22
   - Frontend: [footballFrontEnd#1](https://github.com/rdhPersonal/footballFrontEnd/pull/1) — auth + BFF foundation
2. **Deploy backend Node 22 change**: `terraform apply` to update Lambda runtimes
3. **Full E2E browser test**: Run `npm run dev`, sign in via Cognito in a browser, verify player data renders
4. **Begin Phase 2 or Phase 3** depending on priority — data normalization or UI buildout

